{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10293160","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10293160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1029316001:2":{"text":"테미히아! 오랜만이에요! 보고 싶었어요!","source_cn":"特弥希娅！好久不见，我好想你呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEABACDC0253192A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029316002:0":{"text":"안녕, 페이. 오랜만이네!","source_cn":"你好，菲。好久不见，愿女神保佑你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCADFD7BF9671163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029316003:0":{"text":"나도 여기 있는데... 나랑은 인사도 안 할 거야?","source_cn":"我也在呢，你不和我打招呼吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2501F4021A7F779","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029316004:0":{"text":"아, 아탈란테는 이번 사건의 핵심 용의자예요! 탐정은 용의자에게 근엄하게 보여야 한다고요!","source_cn":"你、你这可是本案的重点嫌疑人！作为侦探，我对嫌疑人态度...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD95D020E43621971","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029316005:0":{"text":"뭐? 용의자? 요즘 훔친 건 없는데?","source_cn":"啊，你说什么嫌疑人？我最近可没有偷什么东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A4516ABE6167004","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029316006:0":{"text":"성석이요! 당신은 성석 도난 사건의 용의자예요!","source_cn":"圣石！你是圣石失窃案的嫌疑人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD645968A4B1F2C00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029316007:0":{"text":"성석? 너희들... 그걸 왜 조사해?","source_cn":"圣石？你们……调查这个做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7888F88925726576","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1029316007":{"text":"성석? 너희들... 그걸 왜 조사해?","source_cn":"圣石？你们……调查这个做什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7888F88925726576","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029316008:0":{"text":"너무 예전 일이라, 기억 나는 게 별로 없네.","source_cn":"这是太久之前的事情了，我已经忘得差不多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAD03A69E48C30D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029316009:2":{"text":"아탈란테, 사실... 나도 그때 무슨 일이 있었는지 알고 싶어요.","source_cn":"阿塔兰忒，其实……我也想要知道当时发生了什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x922C2F6B22C88FAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029316010:0":{"text":"테미히아까지... 그래, 알았어. 그게 어떻게 된 일이냐면...","source_cn":"特弥希娅，你……好吧，我明白了。事情是这样的——","s